{"slug":"/references/js_sdk/admin/RefundReason/methods/js_sdk.admin.RefundReason.list","title":"list","frontmatter":{},"toc":[{"title":"Example","id":"example","level":2},{"title":"Parameters","id":"list-parameters","level":2},{"title":"Returns","id":"list-returns","level":2}],"blocks":[{"kind":"markdown","html":"This method retrieves a list of refund reasons. It sends a request to the\n[List Refund Reasons](https://docs.medusajs.com/api/admin#refund-reasons\\_getrefundreasons)\nAPI route."},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"text":"Example","id":"example"},{"kind":"markdown","html":"To retrieve the list of refund reasons:\n\n```ts\nsdk.admin.refundReason.list()\n.then(({ refund_reasons, count, limit, offset }) => {\n  console.log(refund_reasons)\n})\n```\n\nTo configure the pagination, pass the `limit` and `offset` query parameters.\n\nFor example, to retrieve only 10 items and skip 10 items:\n\n```ts\nsdk.admin.refundReason.list({\n  limit: 10,\n  offset: 10\n})\n.then(({ refund_reasons, count, limit, offset }) => {\n  console.log(refund_reasons)\n})\n```\n\nUsing the `fields` query parameter, you can specify the fields and relations to retrieve\nin each refund reason:\n\n```ts\nsdk.admin.refundReason.list({\n  fields: \"id,label\"\n})\n.then(({ refund_reasons, count, limit, offset }) => {\n  console.log(refund_reasons)\n})\n```\n\nLearn more about the `fields` property in the [API reference](https://docs.medusajs.com/api/admin#select-fields-and-relations)."},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"text":"Parameters","id":"list-parameters"},{"kind":"typeList","sectionTitle":"list","types":[{"name":"query","type":"[AdminRefundReasonListParams](/references/types/HttpTypes/interfaces/types.HttpTypes.AdminRefundReasonListParams)","description":"Filters and pagination configurations.","optional":true,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[{"name":"$and","type":"([AdminRefundReasonListParams](/references/types/HttpTypes/interfaces/types.HttpTypes.AdminRefundReasonListParams) \